2026-07-27T11:50:18.8277298Z i /tmp/Rtmpc9cDvI/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:50:18.8277778Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:50:18.8278331Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:50:18.8278812Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:50:18.8279576Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:50:18.8281004Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:50:18.8282215Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
